@title Lesson page: the whole sheet is in view when a lesson starts
@area Learn
# Creative round 25: a running lesson showed the page shifted, a black band at the left and the sheet
# cropped at the right. A lesson's small page now opens with the whole sheet in view.
click_text "Open example"
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text learn
wait 6
key Enter
wait 30
click_text Start
wait 60
shot lesson-running
check_layout
